<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Resources Devt 1H net up 38 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Resources Devt 1H net up 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 9.50   vs     6.91</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	   30.00   vs    22.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			 133.12   vs   110.91</p>
<p>    Investment income		0.05   vs     0.08</p>
<p>    Other income		     0.56   vs     0.40</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 0.66   vs     0.15</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation    4.15   vs     3.66</p>
<p>    Operating profit		12.77   vs     9.55</p>
<p>    Associates			 0.44   vs     0.23</p>
<p>    Tax				  4.05   vs     2.67</p>
<p>    Minorities	    loss     0.35   vs     0.20   gain</p>
<p>Note-- Resources Development Corp ltd is a diversified building supplies group.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
